# FINAL CREATIVE DIRECTIVE

Make DEAD SIGNAL frightening because the audience gradually learns what the protagonist cannot yet understand.

Make the audience care about Aarav before subjecting him to escalating danger.

Make every episode worth watching on its own while making the complete season more meaningful than the sum of its episodes.

Plant clues early. Pay them off later. Let character decisions drive the plot.

The story must conclude decisively in Episode 7.

**Start with Phase 1 only. Do not write the production scripts yet.**
